  "definition_ja": "数が正であるか負であるかを表す + と − のこと。−7 の符号は −、+7 の符号は + である。",
  "definition_en": "Whether a number is positive or negative, shown by a + or − in front of it. For example, the sign of −7 is negative.",
  "latex": null,
  "spoken_en": null,
  "examples": [
    {
      "en": "When two numbers have the same sign, add them and keep that sign.",
      "ja": "2 つの数が同符号なら、足してその符号をそのまま付ければいい。",
      "register": "spoken"
    },
    {
      "en": "Without multiplying, determine the sign of the product (−2)(−5)(−1).",
      "ja": "計算しないで、積 (−2)(−5)(−1) の符号を答えよ。",
      "register": "written"
